          <div class=3D"vc-faq-list">

            <details class=3D"vc-faq-item">
              <summary class=3D"vc-faq-q">Is this the full game? Do I need =
to upload files? <span class=3D"vc-faq-icon">+</span></summary>
              <p class=3D"vc-faq-a">Yes, this is the full GTA Vice City exp=
erience. No file uploads are required. The game files (~701 MB) are downloa=
ded automatically on your first visit and cached in your browser for instan=
t loads forever after.</p>
            </details>

            <details class=3D"vc-faq-item">
              <summary class=3D"vc-faq-q">How does the Save Manager work? <=
span class=3D"vc-faq-icon">+</span></summary>
              <p class=3D"vc-faq-a">You can upload your existing .b save fi=
les from a PC or PS2 to resume your progress. You can also download backups=
 to keep your virtual progress safe at any time.</p>
            </details>

            <details class=3D"vc-faq-item">
              <summary class=3D"vc-faq-q">Does it support controllers and m=
obile? <span class=3D"vc-faq-icon">+</span></summary>
              <p class=3D"vc-faq-a">Yes. Gamepads are fully supported on de=
sktop browsers. On mobile, integrated on-screen touch controls appear autom=
atically. Play in landscape mode for the best experience.</p>
            </details>

            <details class=3D"vc-faq-item">
              <summary class=3D"vc-faq-q">Why does the game show a black sc=
reen or run poorly? <span class=3D"vc-faq-icon">+</span></summary>
              <p class=3D"vc-faq-a">Ensure your browser supports WebAssembl=
y and Service Workers (Chrome 110+, Firefox 111+, Safari 16.4+). Try a hard=
-refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R). On slow devices, set the FPS limit to 30 above.</p=
>
            </details>

            <details class=3D"vc-faq-item">
              <summary class=3D"vc-faq-q">Why are the physics acting weirdl=
y or missions failing? <span class=3D"vc-faq-icon">+</span></summary>
              <p class=3D"vc-faq-a">The original game was designed for 30 F=
PS. Running at higher framerates can cause physics glitches. Set the FPS li=
mit to 30 in the panel above to fix mission-critical physics.</p>
            </details>

            <details class=3D"vc-faq-item">
              <summary class=3D"vc-faq-q">My device is getting very hot. Ho=
w do I fix this? <span class=3D"vc-faq-icon">+</span></summary>
              <p class=3D"vc-faq-a">Set the FPS limit to 30 to significantl=
y reduce CPU and GPU load. This is especially recommended for mobile device=
s and low-end laptops to prevent overheating.</p>
            </details>

